<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81994" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-πόρφῠρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>edged with purple</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crates Com.
					31
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclid.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτωνίσκοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.114.4
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐσθῆτες</span> garments <i>with a
				purple border</i>, of the Roman <i>toga praetexta</i> or
				<i>laticlavia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.53.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τήβεννα, τήβεννος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Rom.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπόρφυρος</span> alone,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.283a
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖδες</span>), <i>pueri praetextati</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀγών</span> part of name of an
			athletic contest at Sidon, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.129
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPHerm.</u>
				54.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
